NEIL MCCABE: The Democratic talking points are already in the mainstream media's bloodstream, and now it's sort of step two is what do people do with this data?-- In this swirl of 2020 have heard that there were Deep State personnel and elements who were cooperating with foreign powers, specifically Red China, to take down President Trump. 

---It sounds like there's something to it, and it certainly needs to be pursued, that there are Americans involved cooperating. A foreign power can't just walk through and do whatever they want. They have to have someone on the inside.

@ReporterMcCabe
